---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Terms & Conditions | SideHustlesJob";
const description = "Review the terms and conditions governing your use of SideHustlesJob. By using our site, you agree to these terms.";
const canonical = "https://sidehustlesjob.com/terms";
const lastUpdated = "June 6, 2025";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-44 md:pb-32">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

        <!-- Page header -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Legal</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">
            Terms &amp; Conditions
          </h1>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none">

          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Welcome to SideHustlesJob. By accessing or using <strong>sidehustlesjob.com</strong>, you agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree to all terms, please do not use our site.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">1. Use of the Site</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            SideHustlesJob is an informational resource that helps users discover and evaluate side hustle opportunities. You may use this site for personal, non-commercial purposes only. You agree not to:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600">
            <li>Scrape, copy, or redistribute our content without written permission</li>
            <li>Use automated tools (bots, crawlers) to access or index our content beyond standard search engines</li>
            <li>Attempt to disrupt or harm the site's functionality or infrastructure</li>
            <li>Submit false or misleading information through any contact or quiz forms</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">2. Informational Purpose Only</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            All content on SideHustlesJob — including income estimates, startup cost ranges, and time-to-income data — is provided for informational purposes only. Earnings from any side hustle are not guaranteed and depend on individual effort, skill, market conditions, and other factors entirely outside our control. Nothing on this site constitutes financial, legal, or professional advice.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">3. Affiliate Links and Sponsorships</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Some links on SideHustlesJob may be affiliate links, meaning we may earn a commission if you click through and sign up for a service at no additional cost to you. Our editorial content is not influenced by affiliate relationships. We only link to services we believe are genuinely useful.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            All content on this site, including text, graphics, logos, and data, is the property of SideHustlesJob or its content suppliers and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws. Unauthorized use, reproduction, or distribution is strictly prohibited.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">5. Third-Party Links</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Our site links to third-party websites for reference and convenience. We do not endorse and are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or availability of any third-party sites. Accessing those sites is entirely at your own risk.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">6. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            SideHustlesJob is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied. We do not warrant that the site will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of viruses or other harmful components.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            To the fullest extent permitted by law, SideHustlesJob and its owners, contributors, and affiliates will not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of the site or reliance on any content provided.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">8. Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Changes will be effective upon posting to the site with an updated "Last updated" date. Your continued use of the site after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the new terms.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">9. Governing Law</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            These Terms are governed by the laws of the United States, without regard to conflict of law principles. Any disputes will be resolved in the courts of the applicable jurisdiction.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">10. Contact Us</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            If you have questions about these Terms, please contact us at:<br />
            <a href="mailto:legal@sidehustlesjob.com" class="text-slate-950 hover:underline">legal@sidehustlesjob.com</a>
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
